beautiful-ui
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Source:    https://github.com/slev12397/beautiful-ui
  Commit:    ff0f74d
  Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Shane Levine
  Licence:   MIT (full text below)

Used as the visual source for ripple's component re-skin: design tokens, the
`cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)` ease published as `--ripple-ease-out`, several
CSS `@keyframes`, and the layout and type rhythm of a set of atoms and AI
primitives. No source file is copied or imported; each component is a
translation into Svelte 5 against ripple's own tokens. The mapping is recorded
in `docs/design/beautiful-ui-translation.md`.

