-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Provenance header convention
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Every file re-skinned from beautiful-ui carries, in its top comment block, the
line:

  origin: slev12397/beautiful-ui@ff0f74d <path in that repo>

for example:

  origin: slev12397/beautiful-ui@ff0f74d components/primitives/ThinkingState.tsx

Pinning the commit is what makes the claim checkable later — the upstream repo
moves, and "ported from beautiful-ui" with no commit is unverifiable a year on.
Cheap to add now, painful to backfill.
